            "region": "TR",
            "shares": 0,
            "caption": "Salary negotiation practice with ChatGPT 👇 POV: AI played HR in my salary negotiation. It crushed me. Rehearse before the real thing: AI plays HR protecting the budget, you try to win. The fix prompt (copy it, fill in the brackets): Let's rehearse a salary negotiation. You're the HR manager at [company] and your job is to protect the budget. Offer: [X]. My target: [Y]. Role: [role], city: [city]. - Push back like real HR: \"there's no budget\", \"you're junior\", \"other candidates are cheaper\". - After each answer, stop and tell me my weak spot in one sentence. - After 4 rounds: did we reach a deal? Which line worked and which one cost me? - Finally, list 5 things I can ask for besides salary (benefits, training, remote days, a 6-month review) with a one-line ask for each. Save it and send it to a friend who needs it. Do you negotiate your first offer? 👇 #salarynegotiation #careertok #chatgpt #jobsearch #ai",
